```

---

## Secondary path: per-request URLs (not persisted webhooks)

`GetLinkMetadata` and `BatchGetLinkMetadata` fetch metadata for URLs supplied in the RPC request (not stored webhook config):

```13:16:/bench/repo/server/router/api/v1/memo_service_link_metadata.go
